<title>NORWAY: Sysdeco shares suspended from trading.</title>
<headline>Sysdeco shares suspended from trading.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in international software house Sysdeco ASA were suspended from trading on Monday, a statement from the Oslo bourse said.</p>
<p>The bourse said the company had asked for the suspension, pending further information within the next few days.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
